      "summary": "The Expanding Polytope Algorithm (EPA) computes the penetration depth and contact normal for overlapping convex shapes. Starting from GJK\'s overlapping simplex, EPA iteratively expands a polytope toward the boundary of the Minkowski Difference to find the minimum translation vector (MTV) — the shortest way to push the shapes apart."
