      "summary": "Skeletal animation structures 3D meshes as a hierarchy of bones, where vertex deformation is driven by skinning weights. Shaders perform Linear Blend Skinning (LBS) or Dual Quaternion Skinning (DQS) in real-time on the GPU to deform vertices based on joint matrices."
