    slug: 'os-troubleshooting',
    title: "OS Troubleshooting: Diagnosing Boot Failures, Hardware Faults & System Logs",
    tagline: "A textbook guide to BIOS/UEFI boot debugging, memory dumps, hardware checks, and log analysis.",
